# One state of a house (reports/render-features/2026-11-15-night-interiors, step 2): the market house, whose ground
# floor under the front half is Zuris's shop (houses.json: market-zuris-shop, bedtime 23:00) and the rest the inn
# (market-inn, bedtime 00:30). Inside and outside at noon, at 22:30 (all awake), 23:20 (the shop asleep, the inn
# awake), 00:20 (the inn's last minutes), 00:50 and 03:00 (all asleep) and 06:40 (the lamps are back): the lamps
# inside go out before the bedtime, the lit windows of the house fade with them and never outlive them.
# Run with OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<a folder made by scripts/content/window_glow.py pilot>; with OPENGOTHIC_HOUSES=0 the
# same shots show the lamps burning round the clock.
# @timeout 480
cheat god
overlay off
view hide animated morph
cam lift off

# the shop from its front wall: eye 220 cm inside the facade, 150 cm above the floor
set time 12 0
cam look -1530
goto pos 8632.5 2000 3405.2
cam world 380 -1497 24.462
wait 34
cam hold
wait 6000
set time 12 0
wait 3500
shot shop-in-1200
wait 300
set time 22 30
wait 3500
shot shop-in-2230
wait 300
set time 23 20
wait 3500
shot shop-in-2320
wait 300
set time 0 20
wait 3500
shot shop-in-0020
wait 300
set time 0 50
wait 3500
shot shop-in-0050
wait 300
set time 3 0
wait 3500
shot shop-in-0300
wait 300
set time 6 40
wait 3500
shot shop-in-0640
wait 300

